1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,481
Leave ether standing in air and light for months, and it slowly takes up oxygen at the carbon next to the oxygen, forming a hydroperoxide.

2
00:00:10,481 --> 00:00:13,125
The peroxide does not evaporate.

3
00:00:13,125 --> 00:00:22,682
When the old ether is distilled, the ether boils away, the peroxide concentrates in the flask, and near dryness it explodes.

